  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The report rate limit now groups IPv6 callers by /64. The service worker keeps at most 200 entries in each of its shell and API caches, an existing cache over 200 is trimmed on its first write, and it no longer caches runtime responses with Vary: Cookie. The client sends no report when localStorage and sessionStorage are both blocked. The worker now honours the path base. Plain assets refresh in the background. RetentionDays still defaults to 0, and 400 is now the recommended value. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
